OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with some brightness or
OL,6,Feven a little sunshine at first in the
OL,7,Fnorth. Otherwise, a cloudy day with
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain spreading north,
OL,9,Fturning heavier at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will remain cloudy through
OL,12,Fthe evening and overnight with further
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain, turning heavier and
OL,14,Fmore persistent overnight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FCloudy with occasionally
OL,17,Fheavy rain spreading north through the
OL,18,Fmorning. Staying cloudy in the
OL,19,Fafternoon with further showery rain,
OL,20,Fpersistent in places and occasionally
OL,21,Fheavy with a chance of thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
