OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FUnsettled on Wednesday with further
OL,7,Fshowers or longer spells of rain,
OL,8,Foften heavy at times. Brighter on
OL,9,FThursday with a few scattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
